Subject: [PATCH 7/8] fix(brief): brief_context inlines dropped spans shorter
 than an InliningGapMarker marker

compress_context already emitted a dropped span verbatim when an
InliningGapMarker's marker would not be shorter than it; brief_context
ignored the wrapper and replaced a 9-char line with a ~100-char marker.
Output size can only shrink. Plain markers are unchanged.
